man among those who remained behind.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":171,"sd":null},{"k":"26:172","t":"Then We destroyed the others.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":172,"sd":null},{"k":"26:173","t":"And We rained upon them a rain [of stones], and evil was the rain of those who were warned.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":173,"sd":null},{"k":"26:174","t":"Indeed in that is a sign, but most of them were not to be believers.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":174,"sd":null},{"k":"26:175","t":"And indeed, your Lord - He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":175,"sd":null},{"k":"26:176","t":"The companions of the thicket [i.e., the people of Madyan] denied the messengers","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":176,"sd":null},{"k":"26:177","t":"When Shuʿayb said to them, \"Will you not fear Allāh?","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":177,"sd":null},{"k":"26:178","t":"Indeed, I am to you a trustworthy messenger.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":178,"sd":null},{"k":"26:179","t":"So fear Allāh and obey me.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":179,"sd":null},{"k":"26:180","t":"And I do not ask you for it any payment. My payment is only from the Lord of the worlds.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":180,"sd":null},{"k":"26:181","t":"Give full measure and do not be of those who cause loss.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":181,"sd":null},{"k":"26:182","t":"And weigh with an even [i.e., honest] balance.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":182,"sd":null},{"k":"26:183","t":"And do not deprive people of their due and do not commit abuse on earth, spreading corruption.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":183,"sd":null}],"juz":19,"hizb":38,"surahs":[26],"sajdah":false}